OL,3,GNEWSAPeople asked to shape potential
OL,4,Ahate crime law
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Jersey are being asked to
OL,7,Fgive feedback about potential new hate
OL,8,Fcrime laws.
OL,10,FA hate crime is a crime such as
OL,11,Fassault, harassment, threats or
OL,12,Fcriminal damage motivated by hostility
OL,13,Ftowards a person's protected
OL,14,Fcharacteristic, such as race, religion,
OL,15,Fdisability or sexual orientation.
OL,17,FIn the UK, such crimes are covered by
OL,18,Fits Crime and Disorder Act 1998 and
OL,19,FSection 66 of the Sentencing Act 2020,
OL,20,Fbut Jersey has no similar legislation.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
