OL,3,GNEWSAPeople asked to shape potential
OL,4,Ahate crime law
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians said the aim of similar
OL,7,Flaws in Jersey would be to make sure
OL,8,Feveryone was protected from crime
OL,9,Fmotivated by hostility or prejudice,
OL,10,Fwhile also protecting freedom of
OL,11,Fexpression. The consultation is open
OL,12,Funtil Tuesday 12 January 2027.
